            <ArticleTitle>Comparison of surgical approaches to ureteropelvic junction obstruction: endopyeloplasty versus endopyelotomy versus laparoscopic pyeloplasty.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>140-9</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Several minimally invasive approaches to treatment of ureteropelvic junction obstruction are now in the urologist's armamentarium. This review provides in-depth analysis of endopyelotomy, endopyeloplasty, and laparoscopic pyeloplasty and suggests a treatment algorithm for proper patient selection to improve efficacy and minimize morbidity.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
